// tactical_squad_5v5's SquadHeal — single-target ally Heal(12.0). FIRST
// chronicle-pipeline heal ability in this fixture (the existing `Heal`
// verb still emits the legacy `Healed` event via the per-agent kernel;
// SquadHeal is the new verb that writes kind=27 EffectHealApplied via
// the apply_ability dispatcher).
//
// Lowers to AbilityProgram { gate: { cooldown_ticks: 0, hostile_only: false },
//                            area: SingleTarget { range: 50.0 },
//                            effects: [EffectOp::Heal { amount: 12.0 }] }.
//
// `target: ally` semantic (the .sim's body-side `target.level ==
// self.level` enforces same-team predicate today; future predicate
// dispatch will consult `hostile_only = false`).
// `range: 50` is metadata-only at 5v5 scale (verb is per-pair scoring,
// not spatial); signals "any target on the team" without affecting
// dispatch.

ability SquadHeal {
    target: ally
    range: 50
    cooldown: 0

    heal 12
}
